# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# The root Taskfile loads .env via `dotenv`, so these reach lifecycle hooks.
# direnv alone is not enough: it exports on precmd, which a non-interactive
# hook shell never fires.
#
# Never commit real values. A secret pushed once must be rotated, not deleted.

# OPTIONAL — Cloudflare Tunnel token, if you enable the tunnel app in
# ecosystem.config.js. TUNNEL_TOKEN is the name cloudflared itself reads.
# Create a dedicated tunnel for this devbox; do not reuse one that already
# serves something else (see the warning in ecosystem.config.js).
# TUNNEL_TOKEN=
